Recommends: firewalld
Description: PipeWire network audio receiver
 PipeWire Network Receiver listens for incoming RTP audio streams and
 automatically connects them to the system default output sink. It reads
 its configuration from JSON and supports automatic sink switching when
 the default output changes.
 .
 This package installs the receiver component that plays audio received
 from remote PipeWire senders over RTP/UDP.
